      "writtenOn": "2025-11-06T20:57:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This might break the TCPC operational model. There are some sequencing requirements on this bit in TCPCI, and at a high level, a TCPC can use this bit as a signal for whether it\u0027s connected or not. For instance, if ADD is enabled, the LookForConnection command used to enable DRP Autotoggle will be a ignored. That could mess up the transition from an Attached state to DRP Autotoggle. I hesitate to do this.",
      "revId": "d2f3f5d7710455d4646fd28d7d165f3c5bac0c20",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
